# Streaming materials are byte-identity fixtures. JSON/JSONL/TXT stay LF so
# Windows core.autocrlf cannot rewrite line terminators into JSONL or JSON
# string values. *.bin must stay binary: utf8-byte-boundary's tail is LF-
# terminated ASCII that autocrlf would turn into CRLF and shift apply_append
# cursor / prefix_sha256 (stream-json-exact).
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.bin binary
